out":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":1968,"width":320,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"桶が欲しい程の寒さである。風は門の柱と柱","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":1992,"width":320,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"との間を、夕闇と共に遠慮なく、吹きぬけ","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":2016,"width":304,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"る。丹塗の柱にとまつてゐた蟋蟀も、もうど","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":2040,"width":320,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"こかへ行つてしまつた。","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":2064,"width":176,"height":24}]}}]},{"nodeType":"element","tag":"p","layout":{"x":0,"y":2088,"width":320,"height":288},"computed":{"display":"block","textAlign":"start"},"children":[{"nodeType":"text","text":"下人は、頸をちゞめながら、山吹の汗衫に重","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":2088,"width":320,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"ねた、紺の襖の肩を高くして門のまはりを見","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":2112,"width":320,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"まはした。雨風の患のない、人目にかゝる惧","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":2136,"width":320,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"のない、一晚樂にねられさうな所があれば、","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":2160,"width":320,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"そこでともかくも、夜を明かさうと思つたか","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":2184,"width":320,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"らである。すると、幸門の上の樓へ上る、幅","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":2208,"width":320,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"の廣い、之も丹を塗つた梯子が眼についた。","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":2232,"width":320,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"上なら、人がゐたにしても、どうせ死人ばか","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":2256,"width":320,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"りである。下人は、そこで腰にさげた聖柄の","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":2280,"width":320,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"太刀が鞘走らないやうに氣をつけながら、藁","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":2304,"width":320,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"草履をはいた足を、その梯子の一番下の段へ","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":2328,"width":320,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"ふみかけた。","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":2352,"width":96,"height":24}]}}]},{"nodeType":"element","tag":"p","layout":{"x":0,"y":2376,"width":320,"height":384},"computed":{"display":"block","textAlign":"start"},"children":[{"nodeType":"text","text":"それから、何分かの後である。羅生門の樓の","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":2376,"width":320,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"上へ出る、幅の廣い梯子の中段に、一人の男","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":2400,"width":320,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"が、猫のやうに身をちゞめて、息を殺しなが","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":2424,"width":320,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"ら、上の容子を窺つてゐた。樓の上からさす","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":2448,"width":320,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"火の光が、かすかに、その男の右の頰をぬら","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":2472,"width":320,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"してゐる。短い鬚の中に、赤く膿を持つた面","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":2496,"width":320,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"皰のある頰である。下人は、始めから、この","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":2520,"width":320,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"上にゐる者は、死人ばかりだと高を括つてゐ","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":2544,"width":320,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"た。それが、梯子を二三段上つて見ると、上","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":2568,"width":320,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"では誰か火をとぼして、しかもその火を其處","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":2592,"width":320,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"此處と動かしてゐるらしい。これは、その濁","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":2616,"width":320,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"つた、黃いろい光が、隅々に蜘蛛の巢をかけ","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":2640,"width":320,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"た天井裏に、ゆれながら映つたので、すぐに","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":2664,"width":320,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"それと知れたのである。この雨の夜に、この","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":2688,"width":320,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"羅生門の上で、火をともしてゐるからは、ど","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":2712,"width":320,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"うせ唯の者ではない。","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":2736,"width":160,"height":24}]}}]},{"nodeType":"element","tag":"p","layout":{"x":0,"y":2760,"width":320,"height":120},"computed":{"display":"block","textAlign":"start"},"children":[{"nodeType":"text","text":"下人は、守宮のやうに足音をぬすんで、やつ","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":2760,"width":320,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"と急な梯子を、一番上の段まで這ふやうにし","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":2784,"width":320,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"て上りつめた。さうして體を出來る丈、平に","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":2808,"width":320,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"しながら、頸を出來る丈、前へ出して、恐る","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":2832,"width":320,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"恐る、樓の內を覗いて見た。","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":2856,"width":208,"height":24}]}}]},{"nodeType":"element","tag":"p","layout":{"x":0,"y":2880,"width":320,"height":360},"computed":{"display":"block","textAlign":"start"},"children":[{"nodeType":"text","text":"見ると、樓の內には、噂に聞いた通り、幾つ","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":2880,"width":320,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"かの屍骸が、無造作に棄てゝあるが、火の光","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":2904,"width":320,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"の及ぶ範圍が、思つたより狹いので、數は幾","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":2928,"width":320,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"つともわからない。唯、おぼろげながら、知","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":2952,"width":320,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"れるのは、その中に裸の屍骸と、着物を着た","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":2976,"width":320,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"屍骸とがあると云ふ事である。勿論、中には","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":3000,"width":320,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"女も男もまじつてゐるらしい。さうして、そ","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":3024,"width":320,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"の屍骸は皆、それが、甞、生きてゐた人間だ","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":3048,"width":320,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"と云ふ事實さへ疑はれる程、土を捏ねて造つ","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":3072,"width":320,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"た人形のやうに、口を開いたり手を延ばした","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":3096,"width":320,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"りしてごろごろ床の上にころがつてゐた。し","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":3120,"width":320,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"かも、肩とか胸とかの高くなつてゐる部分","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":3144,"width":304,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"に、ぼんやりした火の光をうけて、低くなつ","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":3168,"width":320,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"てゐる部分の影を一層暗くしながら、永久に","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":3192,"width":320,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"啞の如く默つていた。","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":3216,"width":160,"height":24}]}}]},{"nodeType":"element","tag":"p","layout":{"x":0,"y":3240,"width":320,"height":120},"computed":{"display":"block","textAlign":"start"},"children":[{"nodeType":"text","text":"下人は、それらの屍骸の腐爛した臭氣に思は","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":3240,"width":320,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"ず、鼻を掩つた。しかし、その手は、次の瞬","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":3264,"width":320,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"間には、もう鼻を掩ふ事を忘れてゐた。或る","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":3288,"width":320,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"强い感情が、殆悉この男の嗅覺を奪つてしま","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":3312,"width":320,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"つたからである。","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":3336,"width":128,"height":24}]}}]},{"nodeType":"element","tag":"p","layout":{"x":0,"y":3360,"width":320,"height":168},"computed":{"display":"block","textAlign":"start"},"children":[{"nodeType":"text","text":"下人の眼は、その時、はじめて、其屍骸の中","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":3360,"width":320,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"に蹲つている人間を見た。檜肌色の着物を著","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":3384,"width":320,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"た、背の低い、瘦せた、白髮頭の、猿のやう","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":3408,"width":320,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"な老婆である。その老婆は、右の手に火をと","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":3432,"width":320,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"もした松の木片を持つて、その屍骸の一つの","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":3456,"width":320,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"顏を覗きこむやうに眺めてゐた。髮の毛の長","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":3480,"width":320,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"い所を見ると、多分女の屍骸であらう。","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":3504,"width":288,"height":24}]}}]},{"nodeType":"element","tag":"p","layout":{"x":0,"y":3528,"width":320,"height":216},"computed":{"display":"block","textAlign":"start"},"children":[{"nodeType":"text","text":"下人は、六分の恐怖と四分の好奇心とに動か","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":3528,"width":320,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"されて、暫時は呼吸をするのさへ忘れてゐ","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":3552,"width":304,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"た。舊記の記者の語を借りれば、「頭身の毛","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":3576,"width":320,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"も太る」やうに感じたのである。すると、老","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":3600,"width":320,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"婆は、松の木片を、床板の間に挿して、それ","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":3624,"width":320,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"から、今まで眺めてゐた屍骸の首に兩手をか","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":3648,"width":320,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"けると、丁度、猿の親が猿の子の虱をとるや","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":3672,"width":320,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"うに、その長い髮の毛を一本づゝ拔きはじめ","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":3696,"width":320,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"た。髮は手に從つて拔けるらしい。","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":3720,"width":256,"height":24}]}}]},{"nodeType":"element","tag":"p","layout":{"x":0,"y":3744,"width":320,"height":336},"computed":{"display":"block","textAlign":"start"},"children":[{"nodeType":"text","text":"その髮の毛が、一本ずゝ拔けるのに從つて下","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":3744,"width":320,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"人の心からは、恐怖が少しづつ消えて行つ","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":3768,"width":304,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"た。さうして、それと同時に、この老婆に對","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":3792,"width":320,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"するはげしい憎惡が、少しづゝ動いて來た。","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":3816,"width":320,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"――いや、この老婆に對すると云つては、語","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":3840,"width":320,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"弊があるかも知れない。寧、あらゆる惡に對","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":3864,"width":320,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"する反感が、一分每に强さを增して來たので","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":3888,"width":320,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"ある。この時、誰かがこの下人に、さつき門","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":3912,"width":320,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"の下でこの男が考へてゐた、饑死をするか盜","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":3936,"width":320,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"人になるかと云ふ問題を、改めて持出した","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":3960,"width":304,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"ら、恐らく下人は、何の未練もなく、饑死を","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":3984,"width":320,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"選んだ事であらう。それほど、この男の惡を","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":4008,"width":320,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"憎む心は、老婆の床に挿した松の木片のやう","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":4032,"width":320,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"に、勢よく燃え上り出してゐたのである。","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":4056,"width":304,"height":24}]}}]},{"nodeType":"element","tag":"p","layout":{"x":0,"y":4080,"width":320,"height":216},"computed":{"display":"block","textAlign":"start"},"children":[{"nodeType":"text","text":"下人には、勿論、何故老婆が死人の髮の毛を","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":4080,"width":320,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"拔くかわからなかつた。從つて、合理的に","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":4104,"width":304,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"は、それを善惡の何れに片づけてよいか知ら","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":4128,"width":320,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"なかつた。しかし下人にとつては、この雨の","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":4152,"width":320,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"夜に、この羅生門の上で、死人の髮の毛を拔","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":4176,"width":320,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"くと云ふ事が、それ丈で既に許す可らざる惡","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":4200,"width":320,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"であつた。勿論、下人は、さつき迄自分が、","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":4224,"width":320,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"盜人になる氣でゐた事なぞは、とうに忘れて","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":4248,"width":320,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"ゐるのである。","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":4272,"width":112,"height":24}]}}]},{"nodeType":"element","tag":"p","layout":{"x":0,"y":4296,"width":320,"height":120},"computed":{"display":"block","textAlign":"start"},"children":[{"nodeType":"text","text":"そこで、下人は、兩足に力を入れて、いきな","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":4296,"width":320,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"り、梯子から上へ飛び上つた。さうして聖柄","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":4320,"width":320,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"の太刀に手をかけながら、大股に老婆の前へ","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":4344,"width":320,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"步みよつた。老婆が驚いたのは、云ふ迄もな","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":4368,"width":320,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"い。","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":4392,"width":32,"height":24}]}}]},{"nodeType":"element","tag":"p","layout":{"x":0,"y":4416,"width":320,"height":48},"computed":{"display":"block","textAlign":"start"},"children":[{"nodeType":"text","text":"老婆は、一目下人を見ると、まるで弩にでも","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":4416,"width":320,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"彈かれたやうに、飛び上つた。","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":4440,"width":224,"height":24}]}}]},{"nodeType":"element","tag":"p","layout":{"x":0,"y":4464,"width":320,"height":24},"computed":{"display":"block","textAlign":"start"},"children":[{"nodeType":"text","text":"「おのれ、どこへ行く。」","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":4464,"width":192,"height":24}]}}]},{"nodeType":"element","tag":"p","layout":{"x":0,"y":4488,"width":320,"height":240},"computed":{"display":"block","textAlign":"start"},"children":[{"nodeType":"text","text":"下人は、老婆が屍骸につまづきながら、慌て","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":4488,"width":320,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"ふためいて逃げようとする行手を塞いで、こ","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":4512,"width":320,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"う罵つた。老婆は、それでも下人をつきのけ","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":4536,"width":320,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"て行かうとする。下人は又、それを行かすま","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":4560,"width":320,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"いとして、押しもどす。二人は屍骸の中で、","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":4584,"width":320,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"暫、無言のまゝ、つかみ合つた。しかし勝敗","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":4608,"width":320,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"は、はじめから、わかつている。下人はとう","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":4632,"width":320,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"とう、老婆の腕をつかんで、無理にそこへ扭","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":4656,"width":320,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"ぢ倒した。丁度、鷄の脚のやうな、骨と皮ば","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":4680,"width":320,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"かりの腕である。","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":4704,"width":128,"height":24}]}}]},{"nodeType":"element","tag":"p","layout":{"x":0,"y":4728,"width":320,"height":48},"computed":{"display":"block","textAlign":"start"},"children":[{"nodeType":"text","text":"「何をしてゐた。さあ何をしてゐた。云へ。","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":4728,"width":320,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"云はぬと、これだぞよ。」","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":4752,"width":192,"height":24}]}}]},{"nodeType":"element","tag":"p","layout":{"x":0,"y":4776,"width":320,"height":360},"computed":{"display":"block","textAlign":"start"},"children":[{"nodeType":"text","text":"下人は、老婆をつき放すと、いきなり、太刀","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":4776,"width":320,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"の鞘を拂つて、白い鋼の色をその眼の前へつ","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":4800,"width":320,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"きつけた。けれども、老婆は默つてゐる。兩","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":4824,"width":320,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"手をわなわなふるはせて、肩で息を切りなが","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":4848,"width":320,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"ら、眼を、眼球が眶の外へ出さうになる程、","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":4872,"width":320,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"見開いて、啞のやうに執拗く默つてゐる。こ","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":4896,"width":320,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"れを見ると、下人は始めて明白にこの老婆の","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":4920,"width":320,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"生死が、全然、自分の意志に支配されてゐる","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":4944,"width":320,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"と云ふ事を意識した。さうして、この意識","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":4968,"width":304,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"は、今まではげしく燃えてゐた憎惡の心を何","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":4992,"width":320,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"時の間にか冷ましてしまつた。後に殘つたの","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":5016,"width":320,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"は、唯、或仕事をして、それが圓滿に成就し","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":5040,"width":320,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"た時の、安らかな得意と滿足とがあるばかり","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":5064,"width":320,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"である。そこで、下人は、老婆を見下しなが","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":5088,"width":320,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"ら、少し聲を柔げてかう云つた。","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":5112,"width":240,"height":24}]}}]},{"nodeType":"element","tag":"p","layout":{"x":0,"y":5136,"width":320,"height":144},"computed":{"display":"block","textAlign":"start"},"children":[{"nodeType":"text","text":"「己は檢非違使の廳の役人などではない。今","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":5136,"width":320,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"し方この門の下を通りかゝつた旅の者だ。だ","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":5160,"width":320,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"からお前に繩をかけて、どうしようと云ふや","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":5184,"width":320,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"うな事はない。唯、今時分、この門の上で、","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":5208,"width":320,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"何をして居たのだか、それを己に話しさへす","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":5232,"width":320,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"ればいいのだ。」","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":5256,"width":128,"height":24}]}}]},{"nodeType":"element","tag":"p","layout":{"x":0,"y":5280,"width":320,"height":216},"computed":{"display":"block","textAlign":"start"},"children":[{"nodeType":"text","text":"すると、老婆は、見開いてゐた眼を、一層大","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":5280,"width":320,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"きくして、ぢつとその下人の顏を見守つた。","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":5304,"width":320,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","